flowchart LR
  REG[Immutable release registry] --> PRE[Compatibility and security preflight]
  PRE --> CAND[Candidate environment]
  STABLE[Stable environment] --> ROUTER[Traffic router]
  CAND --> ROUTER
  ROUTER --> OBS[Metrics and evaluation]
  OBS --> GATE{All guardrails pass?}
  GATE -->|Yes| PROMOTE[Promote one traffic step]
  PROMOTE --> ROUTER
  GATE -->|No| ROLLBACK[Restore last known-good bundle]
  ROLLBACK --> ROUTER
  ROUTER --> AUDIT[Immutable release audit]
  SHADOW[Sanitized shadow copy] -. no user response .-> CAND
